{title: Your Love Surrounds Me}
{artist: Larry Holder / Elton Smith}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

>Lyrics

Introduction

Verse 1

The foe encamps around me

Their darkened world surrounds me

Far throughout the land.

Yet You're the faithful Giver

So able to deliver

By Your mighty hand.

Chorus

Though battles rage, all fear is gone

Though mountains fall, Your love is strong.

O Lord, my Shield and Savior

You keep me safe from harm

Please hear me when I cry

You hear me when I cry.

My Savior, stay beside me

Renew my strength and guide me,

Ever in Your care

I'm ever in Your care.

Your love surrounds me

Through dark of night,

Your love surrounds me

My guiding light,

Your love surrounds me

I will not fear,

Your love surrounds me

You're always near.

Verse 2

Though mortal danger finds me

And evil seeks to bind me,

Grace and peace I've found.

Amid the daily trials

My soul is safe because

Your love is all around.

(Repeat Chorus)

Though battles rage, all fear is gone

Though mountains fall, Your love is strong.

O Lord, my Shield and Savior

You keep me safe from harm

Please hear me when I cry

You hear me when I cry.

My Savior, stay beside me

Renew my strength and guide me,

Ever in Your care

I'm ever in Your care.

Your love surrounds me

Through dark of night,

Your love surrounds me

My guiding light,

Your love surrounds me

I will not fear,

Your love surrounds me

You're always near.

(Repeat Verse 1)

The foe encamps around me

Their darkened world surrounds me

Far throughout the land.

Yet You're the faithful Giver

So able to deliver

By Your mighty hand.
